  9   4010              IM2_TABLE EQU $C200             ; 257 bytes of $C3: every vector is $C3C3
 10   4010              IM2_JUMP  EQU $C3C3             ; and there, a JP to the routine
 11   4010              ; A loop of exactly one frame, as many lines as the machine draws, that paints
 12   4010              ; a white box on the black border under the paper: 8 lines from the 4th after the
 13   4010              ; one with the frame's signal, white from T-state 87 of each to T-state 157.
